{"id":"18380974697f948b","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-mv-chain.md","title":"MV-Chain","display":"MV-Chain","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-mv-chain","aliases":["93-fact-mv-chain"],"display":"MV-Chain","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-mv-algebra]]","[[93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-mv-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-mv-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"MV-Chain"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f267483f66bfb134\" href=\"?note=f267483f66bfb134\" title=\"93-df-mv-algebra\">93-df-mv-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a47eea6cc9e560d\" href=\"?note=3a47eea6cc9e560d\" title=\"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup\">93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-mv-chain-—-MV-Chain\">fact-mv-chain — MV-Chain</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\)</span> and its term-defined order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf M}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf M}\\)</span> is linear.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\">\\(\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a47eea6cc9e560d\" href=\"?note=3a47eea6cc9e560d\" title=\"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup\">93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\">\\([0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\">\\(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\)</span> are defined below from the projections of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf G\">\\(\\mathbf G\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the algebra-isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>；原一元辅助函数仍以载集元素为自变量，运算族中的解释以单元组为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>区间、Gamma 运算族及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\">\\(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\)</span> 的构造定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\">\\(\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\)</span>；其后关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M\">\\(\\mathbf M\\)</span> 的表示断言不预设该表示对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in|\\mathbf G|:0^{\\mathbf G}\\leq_{\\mathbf G}x\n\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf G}u\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in|\\mathbf G|:0^{\\mathbf G}\\leq_{\\mathbf G}x\n\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf G}u\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nu\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}(x+^{\\mathbf G}y)\\right\\rangle:\nx,y\\in[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\nu\\wedge^{\\mathbf G}(x+^{\\mathbf G}y)\\right\\rangle:\nx,y\\in[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,u+^{\\mathbf G}(-^{\\mathbf G}x)\\rangle:\nx\\in[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,u+^{\\mathbf G}(-^{\\mathbf G}x)\\rangle:\nx\\in[0,u]_{\\mathbf G}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0^{\\mathbf G}\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0^{\\mathbf G}\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\oplus,\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u);[0,u]_{\\mathbf G})\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\oplus,\\operatorname{GammaPlus}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{UnaryLift}_{93}(\\operatorname{GammaNeg}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u);[0,u]_{\\mathbf G})\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{GammaZero}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle[0,u]_{\\mathbf G},\n\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle[0,u]_{\\mathbf G},\n\\operatorname{GammaOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\to\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\\to\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in|\\mathbf M|\\;(x\\leq_{\\mathbf M}y\\lor y\\leq_{\\mathbf M}x)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf G,u,h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\n\\land\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\n\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf M,\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}mv\\text{-}chain}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in|\\mathbf M|\\;(x\\leq_{\\mathbf M}y\\lor y\\leq_{\\mathbf M}x)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf G,u,h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)\n\\land\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\n\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf M,\\Gamma_{93}(\\mathbf G,u))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the chain case of Mundici's representation by unital lattice-ordered abelian groups. The three operation graphs and their indexed family are explicit, including the nullary zero operation. A non-Archimedean MV-chain need not embed into the standard real interval.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-mv-chain-—-MV-Chain","text":"fact-mv-chain — MV-Chain","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-mv-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"f267483f66bfb134","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-mv-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup","status":"resolved","id":"3a47eea6cc9e560d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup","status":"resolved","id":"3a47eea6cc9e560d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LOAbGrpUnit}_{93}(\\mathbf G,u)$ is defined in [[93-df-linearly-ordered-unital-abelian-lgroup]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the algebra-isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","